=head1 NAME

_EXTRACT_EXTENSION_ - Copy given extension from files in the frame

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This primitive copies the given extension of each file to a new file,
leaving these new files in the frame.

If a new file lacks a FITS extension, it is copied from the original file.

=head1 ARGUMENTS

=over 4

=item B<EXTENSION>

The name of the extension to extract, e.g. C<SMURF.EXP_TIME>.

=item B<SUFFIX>

The file suffix for the extracted extension.  If not given,
then the lower case form of the last component of the extension
name is used.  (Should include leading underscore if given.)

=back

